WEBVTT

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.280
My name is Harukaze Doremi, and this is my ninth autumn.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.020
I never thought that such a thing would happen to me.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:18.590
I am finally the world's happiest pretty girl!

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.850
Oh no!

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.000
I'm so late! Majo Rika's gonna yell at me!

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.700
So cool!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.410
So handsome.

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.750
He seems so cool and nice.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.250
Oooh, he's so my type.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.950
Big brother!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.550
That's...

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.000
Higuchi Maki-chan.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.540
I'm late, I'm late!

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.650
Doremi's Boyfriend is a Middle School Student!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.940
Ah, I'll be late for the magazine interview.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.370
Onpu-chan forgot her textbook.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.000
See?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.600
We have homework problems today.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.800
I'll catch up to her and give it to her.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.550
I'll really be late.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.660
Well then, guess I'll use magic.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.020
Isn't that Segawa Onpu-chan, the child idol?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.240
That's Maki-chan's older brother.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.550
You're Segawa Onpu-chan, right?

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.180
No way.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.010
I've been seen.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.200
Eh? When did you get changed?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.120
Oh well.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:11.720
Anyway...

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.670
I can't believe I let a fan see me like this.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.540
Okay...

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.650
Could you sign this for me?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.150
Ah, a UFO!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.470
Huh? Where?

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.830
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.380
Go fall in love with another girl!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.300
Maki-chan's brother...

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:48.180
Maki-chan's brother...

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.140
Please call me Shuzou.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.440
S-Shuzou-san!

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.040
I...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:58.100
I'm Maki-chan's classmate, Harukaze Doremi!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.110
Doremi-chan.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.780
I love you, please go out with me.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.760
Oh my, Doremi-chan.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.410
Oh well.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.680
I have to get back to the company quickly.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:20.760
Finally, finally, it's here!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.630
My spring is finally here, on my ninth year!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.270
What!?

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.410
Doremi-chan and Maki-san's brother?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.470
Why's everything happenin' so fast?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.430
Maybe I'm dreaming.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.350
It's not a dream!

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.780
You idiot!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.100
You're supposed to pinch your own cheek!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:46.410
Anyway, thank goodness, Doremi-chan. Your spring is finally here.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.660
Yep, Doremi's spring.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.600
He promised to meet me tomorrow.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:57.330
So please let me go home early today.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.840
What!? You still have work to do and magic to practice!

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:07.110
Work? Magic practice? Whatever.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.800
She's completely head-over-heels.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.710
This is so stupid.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.520
Maybe next the Earth will be consumed by fire.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.100
He confessed to me.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.520
You love me, I love you.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.860
Love-Love...

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.480
Maki-chan's brother... No, Shuzou-san.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.950
When did he fall for me?

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.400
But I've never spoken to him before.

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.630
Oh well, it was love at first sight.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.290
Doremi!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.360
Were you the one who used my beauty mask!?

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.670
Yes!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.470
Tomorrow, please come quickly!

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:58.070
You're meeting with Maki-san's brother today, right?

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:58.880
Yeah.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.360
Class hasn't ended, yet I'm shivering in anticipation.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.620
Yer so lucky.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:07.440
Harukaze Doremi is the luckiest girl in the world!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.010
Maki-chan!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:25.000
I hope we can get along if I become your sister-in-law one day!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:25.630
Eh?

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.350
Oh? He didn't tell you yet?

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.390
Yesterday, your brother told me...

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:36.350
That he wanted to go out with me.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:44.570
It's impossible for Harukaze-san to get a boyfriend.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:47.440
She must be lying, without a doubt.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.200
You don't need to get mad just because I got a boyfriend before you did.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:50.990
What did you say?

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:52.910
Oh just stop.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.020
Nothin' you say is gonna get through to her.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:08:00.870
This is the first time and probably the last time that Doremi-chan will get so much attention like this.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.000
Please be nice to her.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.960
Harukaze-san won't have a first time or a last time.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.420
What?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.480
You're so loud! Take it outside!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.740
You're so loud, didn't you hear me!?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.730
My brother... likes Doremi-chan?

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:36.280
But... he already likes Mika-san...

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:51.670
See? I told you it was impossible.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.420
Doremi-chan probably can't wait for school to end.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.370
Yeah.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.000
But he's a middle school student, I wonder what we can talk about?

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.730
Don't worry about that, just talk about whatever.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.600
The lead actress appears.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.820
Feast your eyes on this!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.970
The truth is out!

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.610
Harukaze Doremi-san's boyfriend's real girlfriend is...

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:18.250
Huh, I see.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:19.530
So that's how it is.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:20.580
No way...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:24.580
Harukaze-san, aren't you his girlfriend, though?

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:28.040
That photo doesn't prove anything!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:31.120
Yeah! They may be normal friends.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.210
Can't you see just by looking?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.890
The two of them are in love.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.260
I saw it myself.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:43.310
Maki-chan's brother's confession to Doremi-chan.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.420
See!?

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.550
See, see?

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.940
I wasn't lying!

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.980
Then he's two-timing?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.270
Like I said!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.600
Stop that!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.250
My brother...

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.920
He would never do something like that!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.510
He would never do something that terrible!

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.440
Maki-chan...

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:37.080
My brother would never lie.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.160
If he did say that he likes you, then it must be true.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:46.120
But the girl in that picture...

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.900
Her name is Mika-san.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.820
They are good friends through inline skating.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.040
She's not really his girlfriend.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.620
But...

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.750
My brother really loves you.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.460
Thank goodness!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:08.730
Maki-chan, thank you!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.350
My spring is here!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.000
Maki-chan's brother...

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.940
No, Shuzou-san...

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.830
Be careful, Doremi-chan.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:14.340
Yes.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:23.260
We're holding hands... People will think we're a couple.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.630
Hey, look.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.640
That pair of siblings get along so well with each other.

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.210
So this is love.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.600
I'll say goodbye being to the world's unluckiest pretty girl today.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.220
Well then, let's do it.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.240
You can't be scared while moving forward.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.120
You have to look straight ahead.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.050
Okay.

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.520
Doremi-chan, you're doing pretty good.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.740
Yes.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.960
Love is so painful, but...

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:27.530
Shuzou-san is so nice!

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.280
Doremi-chan, hold on tightly.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.360
Okay!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.040
Shu...

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.470
So cool!

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.300
Shuzou-san! How could you let go of me!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.300
Tomorrow is Saturday, so I have the day off.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:02.800
I'll meet you here at 10 o'clock.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:03.280
Sure!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.990
Another date tomorrow.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.560
But I'll be facing training again.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:15.580
Love... Love really is painful!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.230
Huh.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.870
Why was I with that girl?

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.880
I said I loved her!

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:37.060
So I really did tell that girl, Doremi-chan...

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.020
Didn't you say you want to go out with her?

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.690
I see.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.360
I see!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.020
Ahhh, this is bad.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.550
Just when did that happen?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:51.310
Oh yeah, I wanted to get Onpu-chan's autograph for Mika.

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.560
And then...

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:55.950
I don't understand!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.500
Big brother...

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.960
Where did Doremi go?

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.460
She has another date today.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:10.180
She was making rice balls really early this morning.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:14.140
Doremi-chan's gettin' really serious 'bout this.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:19.270
She's ditching her work at the Maho-dou and dating some guy!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.150
Calm down, calm down. Be more patient with her.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:25.560
This may be the only time in her life.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.030
Oh? Onpu-chan?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.980
What's up, Onpu?

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:32.990
Did Majo Ruka tell you to spy on us?

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.490
Where's Doremi-chan?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.120
She's out on a date with Maki-chan's brother.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.420
Great! My magic hasn't worn off yet!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.600
Magic?

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.670
Shuzou-san's so slow.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.450
What's he doing?

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.070
Oh no, this is bad.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:57.790
I can't tell her that this is all a mistake!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.920
But I have to say it, I already have Mika.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.440
Why is everything so complicated!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.230
Shuzou-san!

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:13.700
You're not teaching me how to inline skate today?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.680
That's fine I guess.

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:19.700
Yeah, well, I told you I loved you, right?

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.370
Yes.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.840
I also said that I wanted to go out with you, right?

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:24.610
Yes.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:26.970
Well... Then...

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.510
Yes?

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:29.870
I can't say it!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.530
Mika!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.630
I'm sorry! I made a mistake by saying I loved you and going out with you.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:39.640
Mika!

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.700
Doremi-chan!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.900
So it was...

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:58.550
'Cause of Onpu-chan's magic.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.240
No way...

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.520
But you had fun, right?

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:06.920
If I hadn't used magic, you probably would never have gotten a boyfriend.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.200
Ya really need to think about what you've done!

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:13.470
Didn't we tell you not to use magic to alter people's thoughts?

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:18.470
This is all yer fault that Doremi-chan got hurt!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.720
My heart is in pieces.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:25.230
But, to be honest, I can finally breathe again.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:30.820
I was thinking of the training I would be doing every day, and I'm sure my body wouldn't be able to take it.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.400
I think this must be for the best.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.090
See? All's well now.

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:35.380
All is NOT well now!

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.050
Onpu!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:40.870
Are you using magic to mess with people's thoughts again?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.700
But I have a magic charm.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.760
That charm won't work forever!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:50.160
Something bad could still happen.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:54.060
This ain't just Onpu-chan's problem anymore.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:56.790
But Doremi-chan is used to getting dumped.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:57.820
What?

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:02.480
I wonder if Maki-chan and the others are okay.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:05.020
No, those three are definitely not okay!

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:07.200
Not my problem!

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.640
Hey! Get back here!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.500
Onpu!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:10.980
Boo, boo!

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:17.070
Don't worry about her. Majo Ruka is the one who made her a witch apprentice.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:17.950
Why blame me!?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.370
But what should we do?

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:23.410
Well...

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.420
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:33.270
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.660
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.930
Magical Stage!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.200
Have all the affected people gather here!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.340
That thing is scary.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.880
Why are you doing this?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.640
Shut up!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.110
I'm doing this to expel the evil spirit haunting this boy!

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.610
Evil spirit!?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:43.510
This spirit will make him confess to random people.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.580
No way!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.600
But I did feel weird yesterday.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.500
Don't tell me an evil spirit really possessed me!?

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:59.510
Evil spirit, begone! Evil spirit, begone!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.940
Evil spirit... BEGONE!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.360
It's just an act!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.310
Majo Ruka!

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.090
Big brother, are you okay!?

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.700
Now everything is fine.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:27.930
I've sent the spirit away.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:29.870
What evil spirit!?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.090
I think it's some trick!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:33.760
I won't fall for it!

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.980
Mika!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.330
Mika-san!

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.260
No good?

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:01.490
Mika!

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.080
Shuzou-kun...

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.450
Are you hurt anywhere, Mika?

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.450
You're the one who's hurt.

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:17.420
Let me see.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.100
I...

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.690
I never told you properly... That's why this happened.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.020
I love you.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:40.420
Did the spirit make you say that?

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:41.450
Idiot.

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:52.840
How great, they make a nice couple.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:54.240
Cheer up.

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:58.060
I think you will get another chance sometime, Doremi-chan.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:21:59.300
Sometime?

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:04.990
But!

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:06.670
As long as we have the courage to face ghosts!

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:09.130
As long as we have strong hearts to not fall into traps!

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:11.290
We will definitely pass the level 3 exam!

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:13.420
Even if there's a piece of steak right in front of me,

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:15.880
I think I'll be fine, maybe...

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:16.590
Doremi-chan!

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:18.280
Don't fall fer that trap!

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:21.430
Yes, I won't lose to the steak!

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:22.780
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:25.070
Doremi Aces It? The Level 3 Exam.

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:28.200
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
